  LevelRequirment: 0
  Instructions: Welcome adventurer! You made it to <b><color=#fff59d>Mako Island</color></b>.
    If you're here then I'm assuming you are a recruit to become a <b>Guardian</b>.
    I see you lost your equipment on your way here. Take this, it isn't much but
    it will get you started. Show me you have what it takes! See those <b><color=#f69988>Training
    Dummies</color></b> over there? Go! show me your swing.
  Deliver: That was quite impressive considering what you are using for a weapon..
    imagine what you could do with a sword!
